<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>My First Web Page</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      margin: 40px;
      background: #f4f4f4;
      color: #f90000;
    }

    .box {
      background: rgb(124, 0, 225);
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
      max-width: 600px;
    }

    h1 {
      color: #0066cc;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="box">
    <h1>Hello, World!</h1>
    <p>This is a simple basic webpage created for practice.</p>
    <p>Welcome to my first HTML page.</p>
    <button>Click Me</button>
  </div>
</body>
</html>